# Cloudflare Pages response headers. Copied verbatim to the site root by
# STATIC_PATHS/EXTRA_PATH_METADATA in pelicanconf.py.
#
# script-src carries no hashes because the theme ships no inline scripts; see the
# theme layer rules in STANDARDS.md. The two off-site origins are GoatCounter
# (analytics) and jsDelivr (the pinned mermaid bundle from plugins/merlican).
# style-src needs 'unsafe-inline' because mermaid injects styles as it renders.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'none'; script-src 'self' https://gc.zgo.at https://cdn.jsdelivr.net; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: https://volkancicek.goatcounter.com; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://volkancicek.goatcounter.com; upgrade-insecure-requests
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), autoplay=(), camera=(), display-capture=(), encrypted-media=(), fullscreen=(self), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), midi=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
